{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22010","headline":"寓意诗五首 一 · 白居易","name":"寓意诗五首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"豫樟生深山，七年而後知。\n挺高二百尺，本末皆十围。\n天子建明堂，此材独中规。\n匠人执斤墨，采度将有期。\n孟冬草木枯，烈火燎山陂。\n疾风吹猛焰，从根烧到枝。\n养材三十年，方成栋梁姿。\n一朝爲灰烬，柯叶无孑遗。\n地虽生尔材，天不与尔时。\n不如粪土英，犹有人掇之。\n已矣勿重陈，重陈令人悲。\n不悲焚烧苦，但悲采用迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22010.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22010","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}